# Outline — the keys stored in secrets.sops.json, one value each (`sopsgen
# apply` fills generated ones, `sopsedit` the rest). Values built from other
# secrets live in env.nix. Key set must match secrets.sops.json and
# tests/fixtures/stacks/outline.sops.json.

# Session
# Signs sessions and encrypts data at rest — treat as permanent once documents
# exist. Must be 64 hex characters. openssl rand -hex 32
SECRET_KEY=changeme_hex32
# Authenticates /api/cron.*. It DEFAULTS TO THE EMPTY STRING with no error, so
# unset is a silent state. Use a DIFFERENT value from SECRET_KEY.
# openssl rand -hex 32
UTILS_SECRET=changeme_hex32_different_value

# Postgres
# compose.yaml builds the app's DATABASE_URL from POSTGRES_PASSWORD. The host
# (outline_db) and the user/database (outline) are load-bearing for
# nixos/backup-prepare.sh.
# openssl rand -hex 24
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=changeme_hex24

